{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anulomie 915, la o ferm\u0103 \u00een chisoare din Mrs. Epi. Unspreze ce oameni stau la cuada la micul de Jun. \u0218tiai c\u0103 aici, ni\u0219te medicea un bol navit oameni s\u0103n\u0103to\u0219i, inten\u021bionat chranindu-i cum \u00eencarea obi\u0219nuita unei familii s\u0103race din sud, voluntarii lor licea promis gra\u021bierea. Uite farfuria, p\u00e2ine de malai \u0219i te\u0219i de porum, porc s\u0103rat \u0219i gras, melas\u0103, a proape de loc lapte care ne prosp\u0103t\u0103 sau verde\u021buri. Dup\u0103 vreo 5 luni, cam jum\u0103tate din treiei fac pelagra, erup\u021bii pe piele, probleme cu stomacul, confuzie chiar moarte. Dup\u0103 o esti mare descitat\u0103 au cisi \u00een jur de o suta de mi de oamenii \u00een tot sudu. Medicul Joseph Goldberger, arat\u0103 c\u0103 pelagra nu se iac\u0103 un microb. Vine din ceva ce lipse\u0219te din alimenta\u021bie. Mai t\u00e2rziu prime\u0219te un nume, ni acina o vitamina B. \u00cen anii 1940, ia d\u0103ugat \u00een f\u0103in\u0103 \u0219i \u00een p\u00e2ine \u00een mare parte din Amerika. Cu asta, cu salari mai bune \u0219i \u00een care mai variat\u0103, pe lagra despar\u0103 treptat. Deci ce \u00een care acum ceva ce repar\u0103m? Ad\u0103u\u0219i ce lipse\u0219te \u0219i oboala despar\u0103. \u00cen Amerika, \u00een anul acela un nou n\u0103scut, putea spera la vr\u0103 5-10 \u0219i 5 de ani. Dar s\u0103 repar\u0103m \u00een care ajuta doar dac\u0103 e destul\u0103. Iar \u00een India, nu e.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.94, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anulomie 915, la o ferm\u0103 \u00een chisoare din Mrs. Epi.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 298, 414, 1722, 5211, 11, 635, 277, 26558, 4089, 15351, 417, 271, 78, 543, 3791, 9814, 13, 9970, 72, 13, 50628], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.5155380050857346, "compression_ratio": 1.4047619047619047, "no_speech_prob": 0.45665717124938965, "words": [{"wo